      "message": "I spent time investigating the windows failure, and I am able to reproduce the error on my local window machine.\n\nIt seems the generated `link_layer_packets.h` file needs to forward declare the class which is a friend of a the class before the class is defined, so that it has a well defined scope.\n\nI verified that it\u0027s built successfully by modifying `link_layer_packets.h` to forward declaring all the friend classes of `LinkLayerPacketView` first.\n\n I assume we need to update `link_layer_packets.pdl` or update the PDL generator. I am not sure how to update the generated `link_layer_packets.h` file. If you need help developing on Windows, please feel free to reach out to me.\n\nReference\nhttps://stackoverflow.com/questions/34376316/vs2015-update-1-bug-or-bad-c-why-cant-a-friend-class-access-its-friends-pr",
